afterglow's host is written in Rust for this repository. It follows the behaviour of
Apollo (https://github.com/ClassicOldSong/Apollo), itself a fork of LizardByte's
Sunshine (https://github.com/LizardByte/Sunshine), from which it was ported, and keeps
parts of them: the virtual-key to scan-code table (src/platform/windows/input.rs) and
SudoVDA's driver interface (src/platform/windows/vdisplay.rs). Apollo and Sunshine are
GPL-3.0; so is this host (LICENSE).
